{
"markdown": "### Gestures16\n\nBrings native iOS gesture navigation to iPhone models with a physical Home button, making the device feel more modern and smoother.",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
},
{
"class": "DepictionScreenshotsView",
"screenshots": [
{
"url": "https://siphonostb.github.io/siphonostbrepo/depictions/gestures16/screenshots/1.png",
"accessibilityText": "Screenshot 1"
},
{
"url": "https://siphonostb.github.io/siphonostbrepo/depictions/gestures16/screenshots/2.png",
"accessibilityText": "Screenshot 2"
},
{
"url": "https://siphonostb.github.io/siphonostbrepo/depictions/gestures16/screenshots/3.png",
"accessibilityText": "Screenshot 3"
},
{
"url": "https://siphonostb.github.io/siphonostbrepo/depictions/gestures16/screenshots/4.png",
"accessibilityText": "Screenshot 4"
}
],
"itemCornerRadius": 8,
"itemSize": "{185,400}"
},
{
"markdown": "- **Key Features:**\n\n- **Native gesture navigation:** Swipe up to go Home, swipe and hold to open the App Switcher, and swipe along the bottom edge to quickly switch between apps.\n- **Face ID-style status bar:** Delivers the modern iPhone X look with the clock on the left and a shortcut to open Control Center from the top-right corner.\n- **Lock Screen shortcuts:** Built-in Flashlight and Camera buttons right on the Lock Screen.\n- **Device compatibility:** Fully supports iPhone 8, iPhone 8 Plus, iPhone SE (2020) and iPhone SE (2022) running iOS 16.0 – 16.7.16.",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
},
